  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6901.02 Assistant",
  "priorExpiration": "2021-12-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6901.02 “Assistant” means a person who works under the direct supervision of an operator, but who is not involved in the use, mixing, device wiring to any system already connected to a firing control system or mechanism, testing, discharging, firing, or rendering safe of any pyrotechnic effect, special effect, flame effect, device, or equipment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6900) #10067, eff 12-29-11, EXPIRED: 12-29-21\n\nNew. #13426, eff 8-3-22",
